### Use the serialized DSC property shape (1/5)

**Severity:** `medium`

The direct-execution payload must match the module's serialized settings contract. These properties use snake_case JSON names and each value is wrapped by `BoolProperty`; the current C# member names and bare booleans will not create that shape.

```suggestion
            lmb_lock_enabled = @{ value = $true }
            rmb_lock_enabled = @{ value = $true }
            mmb_lock_enabled = @{ value = $true }
```
